From a97531958e4835361a0e8e938af3482f6d5b0d44 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Micheal Waltz <micheal@ecliptik.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 14:48:27 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] [AGS] Cast every remaining plain-int
 Stream::(Read|Write)ArrayOfInt32 site

Found while confirming patch 0018's build result: with cc_serializer.h
fixed, make build-ags immediately hit 5 more identical-shaped errors in
Engine/ac/gamestate.cpp alone. Patch 0013's own commit claimed "grepped
every ReadArrayOfInt32/WriteArrayOfInt32 call site in the tree, 8
total" -- that grep was incomplete. Redone fresh here (not assumed):
grep -rn "ReadArrayOfInt32\|WriteArrayOfInt32" across the whole Engine/
and Common/ tree finds 18 real call sites needing a cast, not 4.

The pattern in what 0013 missed: every site it did catch passes a
.data()-returning container (std::vector/std::array); every site it
missed passes a bare C-style int[] array name, which decays to a
pointer without an explicit call to inspect -- 0013's own grep likely
matched .data() call shapes specifically, not bare array-name
arguments. Common/script/cc_script.cpp's 4 .data() sites needed no
cast at all: code/fixups are already std::vector<int32_t>, confirmed
by reading cc_script.h directly rather than assuming from the .data()
shape alone.

Same DJGPP-divergence category and same fix shape as patch 0013
throughout: reinterpret_cast<int32_t*>/const int32_t* at each site,
safe because both types are genuinely 4-byte two's-complement on this
platform. Touches:
- Engine/ac/gamestate.cpp (5 sites: globalvars, globalscriptvars,
  old_script_timers, both read and write directions)
- Engine/ac/roomstatus.cpp (2: interactionVariableValues)
- Common/ac/view.cpp (1: loopflags)
- Common/ac/gamesetupstruct.cpp (2: options, GameSetupStruct's own
  savegame read/write)
- Common/ac/gamesetupstructbase.cpp (4: options, reserved -- this file
  already had ONE site fixed by patch 0013, HasMessages via .data();
  these are the two plain-array sites in the same file that patch's
  own grep missed)
- Common/game/interactions.cpp (2: types, load_response)
- Common/game/room_file_deprecated.cpp (2: PolyPoints::x/y)
- Common/ac/inventoryiteminfo.cpp (2: reserved)

Verified: make build-ags gets past every one of these files cleanly.
The only two remaining errors anywhere in the build are
Engine/media/audio/openal.h:18 and Engine/media/audio/sdldecoder.h:22
-- both already documented Phase D stubs (mojoAL/OpenAL, SDL2_sound
decode), neither a new surprise.
---
 Common/ac/gamesetupstruct.cpp        |  4 ++--
 Common/ac/gamesetupstructbase.cpp    |  8 ++++----
 Common/ac/inventoryiteminfo.cpp      |  4 ++--
 Common/ac/view.cpp                   |  2 +-
 Common/game/interactions.cpp         |  4 ++--
 Common/game/room_file_deprecated.cpp |  4 ++--
 Engine/ac/gamestate.cpp              | 12 +++++++-----
 Engine/ac/roomstatus.cpp             |  4 ++--
 8 files changed, 22 insertions(+), 20 deletions(-)

